englishText:
''In forty minutes, people will be shooting at these 19 year old boys. And they will shoot back, and they will kill. That is the law of war: if you don't kill first, they'll kill you. We didn't invent this law.''

Uses AK 5.45x39mm Magazines.

^green;Hold down "Alt Fire" to switch between Full Auto and Semi-Auto.^reset;

''Just like old times.''

The shields of the Arthur Clan are made of a thin metal owing to the lack of easy access to wood in contemporary colonies. Clan smithies are often put to work making new shields for the recruits who lack the real armor of the rest of the clan.

^#CCD8B6;0.6s PARRY | 110HP STABILITY | 0.35s Lower-Raise Delay | 95% DEF.^white;

''''

^yellow;Parry [ALT-FIRE]: 0.6s PARRY WINDOW | 75HP STABILITY.^white;
^#FFEEC6;Light-Footed Offense-Defense [SHIFT]: Perform a quick overhead that auto-transitions into a backstep-thrust attack, dealing heightened SLASH and THRUST DMG | 35s Cooldown.^white;

''Someone once said that a minesweeper makes only two mistakes: the first is when he decides to be one. The second...''

The Kurtz Maschinenpistole 5, an extremely popular SMG used by both military & law enforcement chambered in 9x19mm. Holds 35rnds.

^green;Double-Tap [SHIFT] to switch to a comfortable two-handed grip.^reset;

''Without remorse, breakin' your jaw, and by the end, you'll be a name on a wall. But death is not a disgrace, it's divinity.''

The Dynami-Core Defense Rifle 516 is one of the many derivatives of the ancient AR platform, which saw service even during the Earth-Martian War. Uses STANAG NATO 5.56x45mm magazines.

^green;Hold down "Alt Fire" to switch between Full Auto and Semi-Auto.^reset;

Humanity was full of guns like these, believing that these rounds would be the ones adopted across Earth. Ironically, smaller 'intermediate' cartridges would prove to retain significantly more power at range and guns like these fell out of favor.
Loads SCAR-H 7.62x51mm Magazines.

^green;Hold down "Alt Fire" to switch between Full Auto and Semi-Auto.^reset;

One of the most produced revolvers in history. Smith & Wesson started pumping these out in 1899 & hadn't stopped... that is till they did due to nuclear armageddon. It took some time but eventually the company would bounce back from the fallout & get some juicy contracts from the resurged United States. Police forces on a galactic scale have enjoyed the pistols great reliablity & ease of use for centuries.
Feeds .38 Special Bullets
^green;Double-Tap [SHIFT] to switch to a one-handed grip.^reset;

''Chaos and cruelty took hold after the Great Barrier imploded, leaving Gensokyo open to the ravages of the Outside World, or Earth, as we now know it. I am not a murderer, but to be defenseless is to be foolish.''
^yellow;Parry [ALT-FIRE]: 0.4s PARRY WINDOW | 50HP STABILITY.^reset;
^#FFEEC6;Stake Blaster Combo [SHIFT]: Fire three gun-blasts in quick succession to deal rapid damage. Last shot fires a Youkai-Stake that rapidly deals BLEED damage over 3s | 40s cooldown.^white;

''Follow me, men! Forward!''

A snub nose double-action revolver accepting .357 (9x33mm) rounds. Marketed to civilians as a small and concealable revolver, the Super Eagle-14 was designed to be used within close quarters. It has recently seen use in the hands of People's Army Commissars, and commonly used as a symbol of authority.

^green;Double-Tap [SHIFT] to switch to a one-handed grip.^reset;

''He always said they're better than ours. They don't jam.''

After the German Army captured large numbers of the Soviet PPSh-41 during World War 2, a program was instituted to convert the weapon to the standard German submachine gun cartridge - 9x19mm Parabellum. Can accept Kurtz 9x19mm 35rnd magazines or 71rnd MP41r drums.

^orange;The Sapper: 0.6s PARRY WINDOW | 100HP STABILITY^reset;

''I don't believe in the Gods' existence. Man is the master of his own fate, not the Gods. Gods are man's creation to give answers that they are too afraid to give themselves.''

A front-heavy weapon that serves as the mid-ground between a mace and a sword, making effective use of its axe-head and spike-head which deals THRUST and BLEED DMG.
^#FFEEC6;Double Striker [SHIFT]: Perform two focused attacks, dealing high SLASH and BLEED DMG | 18s cooldown.^reset;

''Just like old times.''

The wooden shields of the Free Company are primarily used to protect against the Brigands whom prefer to sling stones and other projectiles at range.

^#CCD8B6;0.6s PARRY | 110HP STABILITY | 0.35s Lower-Raise Delay | 95% DEF.^white;

''Since there was no need for Woody as a flamethrower-wielding demolitionist, Woody went back to being a rifleman.''

Chambered in a hefty .30-06 (7.62x63mm).

^orange;M7 Launcher: Can load M1 Garand HE Rifle-Grenades.^reset;

''Some people will say to just get a better gun. We would, if we could.''

Uses 9x19mm Browning magazines.
^orange;Absurdly high base accuracy and hit chance.^reset;
^green;Hold down "Alt Fire" to switch between Full Auto and Semi-Auto.^reset;

''Victory is in your veins.''

A small metal shield for parrying strikes. Small shields have the highest parry window compared to other shields, but have very little protection with a much smaller hitbox. This makes small shields vulnerable to projectiles and thrust attacks.

^#CCD8B6;1.0s PARRY | 15HP STABILITY | 0.35s Lower-Raise Delay | 20% DEF.^white;

''We charge. Again. And again...''

A snub nose double-action revolver accepting .357 (9x33mm) rounds.

^orange;Reloads slower than usual.^reset;

^green;Double-Tap [SHIFT] to switch to a two-handed grip.^reset;

''We had vowed to slay this false god. Yet, this promise was not more than a coerced pledge. What difference does it make, which master we serve? We will serve all the same.''

A versatile weapon combining a spear and axe, allowing for precise thrusts, slashing, and armor-piercing stabs.
^yellow;Parry [ALT-FIRE]: 0.6s PARRY WINDOW | 100HP STABILITY.^white;
^#FFEEC6;Counter-Brace [SHIFT]: Brace for an attack. If hit, respond with an ARMOR-PIERCING SPIKE that deals THRUST and BLEED DMG.^white;

A massive scutum shield that can be aimed to provide cover against primitive missiles (but not against contemporary rocket-propelled munitions).

^green;Shield Wall: Can be aimed | 400hp blocking power.^white;  
^#D6DFFF;Shield Bash: Moving at great speeds and colliding with an enemy will deal damage based on the speed of the user.^white;

A solid 9mm pistol design that has seen widespread use in both the military & civilian markets. Today it is no different, as the MK.3 finds its self across nearly every stretch of human space.
Feeds from Browning 9x19mm Magazines.
^green;Double tap Shift to switch to a versatile one-handed grip.^reset;

An SMG used by the troops of the Fairy Guards Regiment. Lightweight and devastating in close-range, this magical weapon offers conventional tactics mixed with impressive suppressive capabilities when used in the air. Reloads via standard Gensidium Catalysts.

^orange;Tuned to deal THERMAL DMG.^reset;

^green;Double-Tap [SHIFT] to switch to a one-handed stance.^reset;

Fast-firing but unreliable. This simultaneously impressive-yet-shoddy piece of kit wears down as quickly as it tears through enemies.

Fed with 9x18mm Scrap SMG Magazines.
^green;Double tap Shift to switch to a one-handed grip.^reset;

Kind'a gun you'd see in the hands of bad guys in old games and TV. Spits out .45's stupid fast. Adding a suppressor to grip onto makes the thing far more controllable, but the gun was never designed with anything resembling precision in mind. Brutal close quarters room clearing is its game.''Fit only for combat in a phone booth.'' an old earth police guy once said. Thousand years of spacefaring later & that's still the case.
Fed with .45 ACP MAC-10 mags.
^green;Double tap Shift to switch to an adaptable one-handed grip.^reset;

Kind'a gun you'd see in the hands of bad guys in old games and TV. Spits out .45's stupid fast. Adding a suppressor to grip onto makes the thing far more controllable, but the gun was never designed with anything resembling precision in mind. Brutal close quarters room clearing is its game.''Fit only for combat in a phone booth.'' an old earth police guy once said. Thousand years of spacefaring later & that's still the case. 
Fed with .45 ACP MAC-10 mags.
^green;Double tap Shift to switch to a comfortable two-handed grip.^reset;

Metal axe of surprisingly decent quality. The head is custom-forged with the handle often being fashioned from pipes and bent into shape.
^orange;2nd and final strike DEFLECTS (resist melee). Final strike deflects with longer window.
^yellow;Parry [ALT-FIRE]: 0.6s PARRY WINDOW | 15HP STABILITY.^white;
^#FFEEC6;Focused Shred [SHIFT]: Ready a powerful sweeping strike that breaks Warrior GUARD/SHIELD stances and afflicts 5s SHREDDING (-25% SLASH and BLEED PROC RES) | 16s cooldown.^white;

The legend itself. The M1911 was the brainchild of John Moses Browning, and is one of his most successful & iconic firearm designs, going on to influence nearly all modern centerfire pistols. Adopted by the US in 1911 as a replacement for the Colt Single Action Army, the M1911 would go on to fight in both World Wars and nearly every single major conflict throughout the 20th century & well beyond.
Fires the heavy .45 ACP bullet and holds 7rnds per magazine.
^green;Double tap Shift to switch to a comfortable two-handed grip.^reset;

The legend itself. The M1911 was the brainchild of John Moses Browning, and is one of his most successful & iconic firearm designs, going on to influence nearly all modern centerfire pistols. Adopted by the US in 1911 as a replacement for the Colt Single Action Army, the M1911 would go on to fight in both World Wars and nearly every single major conflict throughout the 20th century & well beyond.
Fires the heavy .45 ACP bullet and holds 7rnds per magazine.
^green;Double tap Shift to switch to a versatile one-handed grip.^reset;

The long time standard issue rifle of the German Bundeswehr, used by many colonial troops *right now*. Made a name for itself being a robust & reliable weapon that can be used damn near anywhere. 7.62x51mm is heavy, but you could do much worse than having it come out of a G3. The fact that this & its cousin, the FAL, are still kicking should be a testament to both rifles.

Loads G3 7.62x51mm Magazines.
^green;Hold down "Alt Fire" to switch between Full Auto and Semi-Auto.^reset;

With access to only scraps and low-quality metals, underground smiths are forced into utilizing ancient techniques to turn them into usable tools. Repeatedly folding metal can help bring out impurities, but there is only so much one can do with something so impure.
^orange;Final strike afflicts 6s SHREDDING (-25% SLASH and BLEED PROC RES) | ^yellow;Parry [ALT-FIRE]: 0.75s PARRY WINDOW | 45HP STABILITY^reset;
^#FFEEC6;Ki Pulse [SHIFT]: Activating within 2s of a perfect-parry or dodge proc restores 10HP | No cooldown.^reset;

''---''

^yellow;Parry [ALT-FIRE]: 0.6s PARRY WINDOW | 75HP STABILITY.^white;
^#FFEEC6;Counter-Brace [SHIFT]: Brace for an attack. If hit, respond with a powerful overhead strike that afflicts high SLASH DMG.^white;

''A gunslinger asks himself if one chain pistol was enough. The answer is no. Then he asks how long it takes to reload. The answer is yes.''
Fires .36 Cal Paper Cartridges.
^orange;Reloads significantly slower than usual.^reset;
^green;Double tap Shift to switch to a stable two-handed grip.^reset;

''A lifetime of training for a moment of glory.''

Axemen are warriors who act as melee skirmishers. They open up with a throwing axe before marching towards the front with shields up. Their use can easily disrupt an assault, distracting melee units and preventing ranged units from using their weapons.
^orange;Assault Stance: Designated infantry will move towards enemies and attack them.^reset;

''A lifetime of training for a single man.''

While similarly-armored to their crossbowman counterparts, their type of attacks vary depending on the range of their target. They tend to have greater hit rates over their crossbow counterparts and much faster nock speeds but they likewise suffer from an inability to fight in melee.
^orange;Defensive Stance: Designated infantry will not move from its position. Best placed behind cover.^reset;

''A small quantity of ground stops the most thunderous cannon.''

A sandbag that offers tremendous resistance to most forms of ballistic damage, making it incredibly effective against a predominantly ranged enemy. Like other defenses, they are vulnerable to melee attacks.
^orange;Ballistic Defense: Extremely high ballistic resistance, but vulnerable to melee attacks | Not always a target for enemies | Instantly constructed.^reset;

''A spear to the throat does all the same to every human.''

Lowest of the low. These poor sods have been forced into your cruel service and do not fare too well in direct combat alone. They are best placed behind cover where they can launch javelins unimpeded and use their spears against nearby targets.
^orange;Defensive Stance: Designated infantry will not move from its position. Best placed behind cover, but may not always focus on the closest target.^reset;

''A terrifying finality for the trusty fireball.''

Effects: IGNITION

^orange;Scrolls are powerful consumable magic weapons.^reset;

''A well-armed peasant is more dangerous than a knight, for where there is one there are a hundred.''

The bread-and-butter of medieval and ancient forces. The spearman is lightly-armored but highly defensive thanks to his greatshield and longspear. He is also equipped with throwing spears which are used to break enemy lines to great effect.
^orange;Assault Stance: Designated infantry will move towards enemies and attack them.^reset;

''Arrows are just smaller javelins.''

Two barrels filled with arrows and bolts. While both of these ammo types lacked the raw power that a javelin could offer, significantly more arrows/bolts could be transported to the troops which drastically increased the staying power of missile infantry.
^orange;Ranged Bolster: Nearby archers and crossbowmen gain +50% DMG | Instantly constructed.^reset;

''Buried underground on an unknown island, a wealthy noble constructed a crypt in memory of those lost in the Shogunate's war against the Machinarius. His closest friend was erased from history for his ties to a shunned religion.''

^orange;Final strike sends out icicles that fire off forwards a short distance^reset; | ^yellow;Parry [ALT-FIRE]: 0.6s PARRY WINDOW | 75HP STABILITY.^white;
^#FFEEC6;Winter-Pierce [SHIFT]: Leap into the air and stab downwards, firing additional icicle projectiles downwards | 25s Cooldown.

''Chaos and cruelty took hold after the Great Barrier imploded, leaving Gensokyo open to the ravages of the Outside World, or Earth, as we now know it. I am not a murderer, but to be defenseless is to be foolish.''
^yellow;Parry [ALT-FIRE]: 0.4s PARRY WINDOW | 50HP STABILITY.^reset;
^#FFEEC6;Stake Blaster Combo [SHIFT]: Fire three gun-blasts in quick succession to deal rapid damage. Last shot fires a Youkai-Stake that rapidly deals BLEED damage over 3s | 30s cooldown.^white;

''Come on you dogs! Do you want to live forever!?''

^orange;Activation grants all nearby PLAYERS including the user 2s of DMG IMMUNITY.^reset;

^red;Must be equipped for 2 seconds before it can be activated.^reset;

Each activation costs a Gensidium Shard.

''Even the lowest wall can buy precious time.''
A low wooden palisade that offers rudimentary cover from ranged attacks. While infantry can maneuver through defenses with little risk by itself, these palisades can delay them as they move through. Pair with defensive units to better protect them whilst opening up enemy melee troops to attack.
^orange;Infantry Defense: Infantry are delayed and unshielded when moving through | Not always a target for enemies | Instantly constructed.^reset;

''Every drop of sweat in drill is every drop of blood saved in battle.''

Rather decently-equipped troops, these crossbowman are given 'good enough' chainmail that helps them survive against ranged attacks. Don't expect them to fight in melee though, as they'll be quickly overwhelmed.
^orange;Defensive Stance: Designated infantry will not move from its position. Best placed behind cover.^reset;

''Every part of human history is buried under a scorching sky set ablaze by our darkest demons and drowned under an ocean of the blood of our brightest angels.''

^orange;50% of DMG converted to THERMAL | 2nd strike DEFLECTS (resist melee) | Final strike afflicts 4s IGNITION.^reset;
^yellow;Parry [ALT-FIRE]: 0.75s PARRY WINDOW | 45HP STABILITY.^reset;
^#FFEEC6;Enflamed Strike [SHIFT]: Perform a heavy upper slash, spewing flames a distance forwards that afflict IGNITION | 16s cooldown.^reset;

''Going from toting a machine gun... to using a bed pan, and I can't even put my own socks on - that was hard to kind of suck it up.''

The Kurtz Maschinenpistole 5, an extremely popular SMG used by both military & law enforcement chambered in 9x19mm. Holds 35rnds.

^green;Double-Tap [SHIFT] to switch to a questionable one-handed stance.^reset;

''Great Sage is dead. Gensokyo must fall.''

^orange;Reloads significantly slower than usual.^reset;
^green;Double tap Shift to switch to a stable two-handed grip.^reset;

''Gunpowder; the downfall of civilizations.''

A sapper armed with a primitive but high-caliber fire lance. The rounds fired by these lances aren't particularly accurate, but they deal tremendous damage against anything they hit.

^orange;Assault Stance: Designated infantry will move towards enemies and attack them.^reset;

''Human sorcerers have an interesting tendency to attribute familiar motions to their magic. Perhaps it just makes casting easier on them.''

Effects: 2s REND-BLEED | HEAVY BLEEDING

^orange;Scrolls are powerful consumable magic weapons.^reset;

''Humanity reveled in their weapons development. But after such illustrious feats, lethargy festered within their genius. Without passion and purpose, there can be no innovation.''

Chambered in 9x18mm. Holds 35 rounds with controllable recoil management for long bursts of fire.

^green;Double-Tap [SHIFT] to switch to a two-handed stance.^reset;

''Humanity reveled in their weapons development. But after such illustrious feats, lethargy festered within their genius. Without passion and purpose, there can be no innovation.''
Chambered in 9x18mm. Holds 35 rounds with controllable recoil management for long bursts of fire.

^green;Hold down "Alt Fire" to switch between Full Auto and Semi-Auto.^reset;

^green;Double-Tap [SHIFT] to switch to a questionable one-handed stance.^reset;

''Hundreds of thousands of Youkai have been displaced into this realm. Thousands more are materializing every week.''

Chambered in a 9x19mm cartridge.

^green;Double tap Shift to switch to a versatile one-handed grip.^reset;

''I am the immortal Shell... I am the immortal Shell... Many times I've died. Many times I've rose.''

^orange;Final strike deals 1.25x DMG | Slightly longer than regular spears.

^#FFEEC6;Samurai Spirit [SHIFT]: Summons the spirit of Sun Tachishige to slash across a wide area | 25s cooldown.^white;

''I desire not to keep my place in this accursed realm an hour longer than I may preserve mankind in its right to exist as a peoples.''
For a period of time after the fall of the Tengu, there still weren't enough weapons to go around. Those without firearms or sorceries were given pikes and swords, and trained in the warfare of old.
^#FFEEC6;Has no ability but can be one-handed and held out. Royalists often paired this with a tuck.^reset;

''I have outlived that care that curries public favour or dreads the public frown... let the hand of law strike me down if it will, but I ask that my story be heard and considered.''

Fires .36 Cal Paper Cartridges.

^orange;Reloads significantly slower than usual.^reset;
^green;Double tap Shift to switch to a stable two-handed grip.^reset;

''I just needed one shot. Pull out this thing and shoot him in the body. It's all I needed to do. So I do. And I miss, twice.''

^yellow;Fires 2 18.5x70mm slug or buckshot rounds^reset; loaded in a break-action fashion.
^green;Double tap Shift to switch to an^reset; impractical ^green;one-handed grip.^reset;

''I was given a choice: to kneel before the executioner's axe or their queen. An easy choice. For years, I wore her sigil and repeated all the oaths. But I always knew one day, no matter how many honors were bestowed upon me, I would escape.''

The longsword is a quick, effective, and versatile weapon capable of deadly thrusts, slices, and mordhau maneuvers.
^yellow;Parry [ALT-FIRE]: 0.4s PARRY WINDOW | 150HP STABILITY.^reset;
^#FFEEC6;Hilt Bash [SHIFT]: Quickly bash a target, stunning them for 2s.^reset;

''I was given a choice: to kneel before the executioner's axe or their queen. An easy choice. For years, I wore her sigil and repeated all the oaths. But I always knew one day, no matter how many honors were bestowed upon me, I would escape.''
The longsword is a quick, effective, and versatile weapon capable of deadly thrusts, slices, and cuts.
^yellow;Parry [ALT-FIRE]: 0.75s PARRY WINDOW | 45HP STABILITY.^reset;
^#FFEEC6;Hard Striker [SHIFT]: Prepare a singular focused attack, dealing high SLASH and BLUNT DMG | 12s cooldown.^reset;

''I was given a choice: to kneel before the executioner's axe or their queen. An easy choice. For years, I wore her sigil and repeated all the oaths. But I always knew one day, no matter how many honors were bestowed upon me, I would escape.''
The longsword is a quick, effective, and versatile weapon capable of deadly thrusts, slices, and cuts.
^yellow;Parry [ALT-FIRE]: 0.75s PARRY WINDOW | 75HP STABILITY.^reset;
^#FFEEC6;Hard Striker [SHIFT]: Prepare a singular focused attack, dealing high SLASH and BLUNT DMG | 12s cooldown.^reset;

''I, JOSHUA TARISH, DO SWEAR - THAT - I WILL WELL AND TRULY SERVE - OUR SOVEREIGN LORD THE KING - AS A POLICE OFFICER WITHOUT FAVOUR OR AFFECTION - MALICE OR ILL-WILL. SO HELP ME GOD.''
The Glock 17 is chambered in 9x19mm ammunition with respect to the philosophy of lightweight weaponry.

^green;Double tap Shift to switch to an automatic one-handed grip.^reset;

''Javelins are like giant arrows.''

A simple rack equipped with throwing spears. Your typical spearman will carry his large longspear and a much shorter throwing spear for breaking apart enemy shield formations.

^orange;Spearman Bolster: Nearby spearmen gain +100% DMG | Instantly constructed.^reset;

''Most people look at this thing and think it's no better than a piece of junk. They're not wrong, it *is* made from shit. Doesn't mean it's shit though, eh?''

The magazines for these kinds of guns are often custom-made, and thus incompatible with each other. For that purpose, you must load the bullets manually on-the-fly. Loads 7.62x39mm bullets.

^orange;Wrought Havoc: 0.4s PARRY WINDOW | 150HP STABILITY^reset;

''Most people look at this thing and think it's no better than a piece of junk. They're not wrong, it *is* made from shit. Doesn't mean it's shit though, eh?''

Packing the common 7.62x39mm bullet as its cartridge and accepting standard 30rnd STANAG-USM magazines, this gun sees use where its bullets are more common than Credits.

^green;Hold down "Alt Fire" to switch between Full Auto and Semi-Auto.^reset;

''Muh' stoppin' power.''

Fires the heavy .45 ACP bullet and holds 7rnds per magazine.

^orange;Bullets deal ridiculous knockback | Knockback-affected enemies take terrain impact damage dependent on velocity | Cannot one-hand | Cannot use special ammo.^reset;

''My shoulder's gonna hurt after this.''

The Right Arm of the Free Galaxy, this rifle is but one of many variations and production models across charted human space. Cheap and reliable, this weapon has seen itself in the hands of Insurgencies, Policing Forces and every area in-between. Loads FAL 7.62x51mm Magazines.

^orange;The Rebellious: 0.6s PARRY WINDOW | 100HP STABILITY^reset;

''No guide that came before can show the way beyond the pass
No footprints on the trail for you to follow in the tracks
For you to make it there you have to leave without the map.''

^orange;HIT CHANCE replaced with CRIT CHANCE. CRIT Arrows have different effects based on the arrow.^reset;

Launches Wooden Arrows.^reset;

''Not all were willing to chip in their part for the defense against the lunarians. There were times where feral youkai would continue to prowl the nights for victims. Volunteers would head out to take youkai nests by surprise. Some of them even made it back.''
^orange;Final strike converts all DMG into 2x PSYCHIC at cost of range.
^yellow;Parry [ALT-FIRE]: 0.6s PARRY WINDOW | 40HP STABILITY.^white;
^#FFEEC6;Prayer Response [SHIFT]: Raise the spear in salute, summoning two bouncing YIN-YANG orbs. After 5 seconds, the orbs explode in a barrage of talismans | 35s Cooldown.^white;

''Oh, my dear Mankind has learnt so much with this fire. Oh how I wish they hadn't!''

A common torch formed by wrapping a drenched cloth around the end of a wooden stick. When society falls and technology fails, a primitive torch will be there to light the way.

^#FFEEC6;Flame Spread [SHIFT]: Thrust forward, sending forth a wave of flames that afflict IGNITION | 25s Cooldown.^white;

''Only the mad stayed to continue their war against The Flesh. They too joined their ranks in the end.''

^orange;Each strike increases in DMG | Final strike DEFLECTS (resists melee) and afflicts 2s STAGGER.
^yellow;Parry [ALT-FIRE]: 0.4s PARRY WINDOW | 35HP STABILITY.^white;

^#FFEEC6;Stone Spikes [SHIFT]: Perform a heavy slam whilst causing spikes to rise from the ground in both directions | 25s Cooldown.^white;

''Only the most desperate are going to charge into battle with this thing.''

^orange;Final strike deals 1.5x DMG, breaks Warrior GUARD/SHIELD stances, and afflicts 2s STAGGER.
^yellow;Parry [ALT-FIRE]: 0.6s PARRY WINDOW | 30HP STABILITY.^white;
^#FFEEC6;Jawbreaker [SHIFT]: Tackle a foe in front of you, afflicting STAGGER for 3s. Follows up with an electrifying Overhead-Thrust that outputs a blast of lightning | 35s cooldown.^white;

''Per Mare, Per Terram.''

The Sten Gun was historically chambered for 9x19mm Parabellum with the intent of utilizing the same ammunition as the Germans so that it could be resupplied from enemy depots.

^orange;The Marine: 0.6s PARRY WINDOW | 100HP STABILITY^reset;

''Prepared as we were, we pushed on to meet our ancestors: a stagnant, dying civilization.''
^yellow;Afflicts hit targets with SUDDEN-STRIKE, granting subsequent shots +50% DMG. If the target is not hit again for 0.5s (integrally-suppressed), the target becomes RESISTANT to SUDDEN-STRIKE for 480s.^white;
^orange;Each ''true'' shot has a 50% chance to cause PANIC in enemy infantry for a short duration.^reset; Uses AS-VAL 9x39mm Magazines.
^green;Hold down "Alt Fire" to switch between Full Auto and Semi-Auto.^reset;

''Protectors freak the fuck out when they see this coming their way. If I can't kill them, then I'll make them feel every second of their death. Yeah, run you little shits! Run!''
^#D96045;Whirligig Whirly-Gig: When held out, deal rapid contact damage but no knockback and cannot rotate aim when held out | Deals heavy bleeding on hit.
^#D6DFFF;Perseverance: [SHIFT] to channel the weapon's spirit, momentarily stunning nearby enemies. Gain total knockback resistance for 20s | 30s cooldown.^reset;

''Reap the eternal from the mind. See the water fall. Cast all the suffering aside lest it cover all.''
^orange;Final strike afflicts 5s RENDING (Bleeding deals +20 DMG/s | No effect if not bleeding).^reset;
^#D6DFFF;Blood Bestowal [BLINK into enemy]: Empowers ANY melee with BLOOD SLASHES for 3s | 0.5s windup | 80 MP.^reset;
^#FFEEC6;Shinobi Iaijutsu [SHIFT]: Perform a simple yet quick double-slash followed by a sheathing retreat | 20s cooldown.^reset;

''Rejoice not against me, O mine enemy: when I fall, I shall arise; when I sit in darkness, the LORD shall be a light unto me.''

^orange;Deals SLASH and BLEED DMG on all strikes atop spear range with a larger hitbox.^reset;
^yellow;Parry [ALT-FIRE]: 0.4s PARRY WINDOW | 30HP STABILITY.^white;
^#FFEEC6;Rending Brace [SHIFT]: Raise the saw forward, bracing for 10s. Deals repeated damage, mitigating high DODGE units such as cavalry | 35s cooldown.^reset;

''Soldiers always come in groups, and so should your bullets.''

Despite its haphazard assembly, the makeshift semi-auto pistol proves to be surprisingly reliable in combat, with a rusty barrel, crude trigger, and cobbled-together magazine all working together seamlessly to pack a powerful punch. Chambered in a hefty 7.62x39mm cartridge.

^green;Double tap Shift to switch to a versatile one-handed grip.^reset;

''The AI knows. Send a killer to catch a killer. No... No, no! You are not what you were! Whatever you heard, whatever you remember, you are not that, not anymore.''

